  "mkt-ai-seo": "用「AI 可见度快检」给【品牌或官网】做一轮 AI 搜索可见度快检，列出优先改进项。须交付：audit-checklist.md、audit-checklist.html、competitor-visibility.md、competitor-visibility.html。\n\n标准成果清单：\n1. audit-checklist.md\n2. audit-checklist.html\n3. competitor-visibility.md\n4. competitor-visibility.html\n写入系统分配任务目录。",
  "geo-aeo-audit": "用「AI可见审计」对【官网 URL】做四维 GEO 评分，输出修复清单与优先级。须交付：geo-aeo-audit-checklist.md、geo-aeo-audit-checklist.html。\n\n标准成果清单：\n1. geo-aeo-audit-checklist.md\n2. geo-aeo-audit-checklist.html\n写入系统分配任务目录。",
